===Etymology 2===
From the pre-1917 acronym {{m|ru|МУС}} for {{m|ru|[[московский|Моско́вский]] [[уголо́вный]] [[сыск]]|t=[[:w:Moscow Criminal Investigations Department|Moscow Criminal Detective Department]]}}. Influenced by etymology 1.

